---
import { Image, getImage } from "astro:assets";
import hand from "../assets/images/hand.svg";
import bg from "../assets/images/bg-about.webp";

const optimizedBg = await getImage({ src: bg });
---

<section id="about" class="about" style={`--bgUrl: url(${optimizedBg.src});`}>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>About</h2>
    <div class="new-features">
      <ul class="new-features__items">
        <li class="new-features__item">3 days and nights of dance music</li>
        <li class="new-features__item">Diverse programming</li>
        <li class="new-features__item">3 unique stages</li>
        <li class="new-features__item">Variety of camping options</li>
        <li class="new-features__item">Luxury amenities</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p>
      Passage Gathering has proven to be - in both name and effect - a catalyst moment. It was created in 2020 as a
      manifestation of love and a determination to emerge from the cocoon of isolation healthier and more connected to
      self and friends.
    </p>

    <p>
      The Covid threat was waning, and we needed to be together. That sweet togetherness combined with a collective
      intention to turn the page to a new era defined - and still defines - the Passage experience as it continues to
      grow. We hope the experiences had on this beautiful 60 acres are an emergence of spirit for you as they have been
      for so many during the first 5 years of Passage.
    </p>
    <p>
      From joyful, ecstatic house music to deeply tribal rhythms from beyond the bounds of time, we use sound as a
      catalyst for it all. Join us and see what unfolds in what is becoming one of the most beloved dance music events
      in our part of the world.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .about {
    --container-max-width: 70ch;
    background: var(--bgUrl) center center no-repeat;
    background-size: cover;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    color: white;
    isolation: isolate;

    @media (min-width: #{utils.getBreakpoint('lg')}) {
      background-attachment: fixed;
    }

    &::before {
      content: "";
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      position: absolute;
      z-index: -1;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }
  }

  h2 {
    color: white;
  }

  .new-features {
    margin-block: 1.5em;
    &__title {
      font-size: #{utils.makeClamp(18, 24)};
      text-align: center;
    }
    &__items {
      @include utils.resetList;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.25em 1em;
      font-size: #{utils.makeClamp(12, 14)};
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5ex;
    }
    &__item {
      padding: 1em;
      line-height: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
